# Animation Components
Entrance animations triggered by scroll position using Intersection Observer API.
## Fade In Component
**Location:** `Animations::FadeInComponent`
Fades content in as it enters viewport.
### Parameters
- `delay:` - Animation delay in milliseconds (default: 0)
- `duration:` - Animation duration (CSS value)
### Features
- Intersection Observer-based trigger
- Configurable timing
- Smooth opacity transition
- GPU-accelerated
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Animations::FadeInComponent.new(delay: 100) do %>
  <h2>This fades in</h2>
<% end %>
```
### Staggered Effect
```erb
<% items.each_with_index do |item, i| %>
  <%= render Animations::FadeInComponent.new(delay: i * 100) do %>
    <%= render CardComponent.new(item: item) %>
  <% end %>
<% end %>
```
## Slide Up Component
**Location:** `Animations::SlideUpComponent`
Slides content up from below as it enters viewport.
### Parameters
- `delay:` - Animation delay in milliseconds (default: 0)
- `distance:` - Slide distance (CSS value, default: "2rem")
### Features
- Intersection Observer-based
- Configurable slide distance
- Combined opacity and transform
- Hardware acceleration
### Usage
```erb
<%= render Animations::SlideUpComponent.new(delay: 200) do %>
  <%= render Card::PostComponent.new(post: @post) %>
<% end %>
```
### Grid Animation
```erb
<div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-6">
  <% @posts.each_with_index do |post, i| %>
    <%= render Animations::SlideUpComponent.new(delay: i * 150) do %>
      <%= render Card::PostComponent.new(post: post) %>
    <% end %>
  <% end %>
</div>
```
## Implementation Details
### Intersection Observer
Both components use:
```javascript
const observer = new IntersectionObserver(entries => {
entries.forEach(entry => {
if (entry.isIntersecting) {
entry.target.classList.add('animate-in');
}
});
}, { threshold: 0.1 });
```
### CSS Classes
Initial state: `opacity-0 transform translate-y-0`
Animated state: `opacity-100 transform translate-y-0 transition-all`
### Performance
- Uses `will-change: transform, opacity`
- GPU-accelerated transforms
- Observer disconnects after animation
- Respects `prefers-reduced-motion`
## Best Practices
**Subtle delays:** Keep delays under 500ms
**Group animations:** Use staggered delays for lists
**Threshold tuning:** Adjust `threshold` for trigger point
**Reduced motion:** Respect accessibility preferences
**Mobile performance:** Test on lower-end devices
